addp("2026-11-13",[SS,SP,IN,SEDA],"What's Chippening #95 (Silicon Saxony, Frank Bösenberg): SEMICON Europa, série A 90 mil. USD pro drážďanskou Sparxity, 300mm SiC wafer Infineonu, miliardový polovodičový fond Ardian, diamantové wafery pro chlazení čipů a plánované převzetí Lauterbachu Siemensem.","What's Chippening #95 (Silicon Saxony, Frank Bösenberg): SEMICON Europa, Dresden-based Sparxity's USD 90 million Series A, Infineon's 300 mm SiC wafer, Ardian's billion-euro semiconductor fund, diamond wafers for chip cooling and Siemens' planned takeover of Lauterbach.","What's Chippening #95 (Silicon Saxony, Frank Bösenberg): SEMICON Europa, 90-Mio-USD-Series-A für das Dresdner Sparxity, Infineons 300-mm-SiC-Wafer, Ardians Milliarden-Halbleiterfonds, Diamantwafer für die Chipkühlung und Siemens' geplante Übernahme von Lauterbach.","zt11Ad2bPOA",True)
