addp("2026-10-30",[SS,IN,SP,GF],"What's Chippening #93: Infineon investuje 1,1 mld. EUR do výroby GaN ve Villachu, SpiNNcloud se přejmenovává na Sparxity, strategické partnerství Volkswagen–NXP, řídicí centrum GlobalFoundries v Singapuru.","What's Chippening #93: Infineon invests EUR 1.1 billion in GaN manufacturing in Villach, SpiNNcloud becomes Sparxity, the Volkswagen–NXP strategic partnership and GlobalFoundries' facilities control centre in Singapore.","What's Chippening #93: Infineon investiert 1,1 Mrd. EUR in die GaN-Fertigung in Villach, SpiNNcloud wird Sparxity, strategische Partnerschaft Volkswagen–NXP und GlobalFoundries' Facilities Control Centre in Singapur.","At5y-o9xW7E")
