addp("2026-10-16",[SS,AP,GF,IN],"What's Chippening #91: otevření EPIC Center Applied Materials, SEMICON West, zakázka TSMC pro GlobalFoundries a dvě nové fabriky, hodnocení Chips Actu 1 (Tobias Wuttke), Infineon a Wolfspeed.","What's Chippening #91: opening of Applied Materials' EPIC Center, SEMICON West, GlobalFoundries' TSMC order and two new fabs, an evaluation of Chips Act 1 (Tobias Wuttke), Infineon and Wolfspeed.","What's Chippening #91: Eröffnung des EPIC Center von Applied Materials, SEMICON West, GlobalFoundries' TSMC-Auftrag und zwei neue Fabs, Bewertung des EU Chips Act 1 (Tobias Wuttke), Infineon und Wolfspeed.","N43sNB3HlDQ")
