addp("2026-10-02",[SS,IN,GF],"What's Chippening #89: otevření lokalit VSMC a Infineonu (Bangkok), FIRST by FMD, nedostatek kvalifikovaných lidí v polovodičovém průmyslu; GlobalFoundries sází na GaN, TSMC a šest fabrik v Texasu.","What's Chippening #89: VSMC and Infineon (Bangkok) open sites, FIRST by FMD, the skills shortage in the semiconductor industry; GlobalFoundries bets on GaN, TSMC and six fabs in Texas.","What's Chippening #89: VSMC und Infineon (Bangkok) eröffnen Standorte, FIRST by FMD, Fachkräftemangel in der Halbleiterindustrie; GlobalFoundries setzt auf GaN, TSMC und sechs Fabs in Texas.","orTpfzjMMVs")
